#~ "Trying to herd cats into getting into one place every week has taught you "
#~ "something: it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  "
#~ "For that reason, when you had two no-shows and the other two tried to eat "
#~ "you, you ditched.  Maybe you can find some new players in the ruins of "
#~ "the world."
