#~ "This is some form of eldritch monstrosity; an uncouth black being with "
#~ "smooth, oily, skin and unpleasant horns that curve inward toward each "
#~ "other.  Tall and thin, the shadows cling unnaturally to its vaguely "
#~ "defined humanoid form as it shuffles along, its hands twitching and "
#~ "spasming so rapidly as to appear a little more than a black blur of "
#~ "claws.  Gazing upon its disturbing form fills you with an unspeakable "
#~ "terror."
