#~ "менее питательна, чем обычная."

#~ msgid "Saprophage"
#~ msgstr "Сапрофаг"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You prefer to sustain your nutritional needs using your roots and direct "
#~ "nutrient extraction/synthesis.  Your human parts still need the raw "
#~ "caloric bulk of 'food' to keep them going, though, and you handle it a "
#~ "lot easier if it's had time to… age a little."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Вы предпочитаете обеспечивать свои потребности в питании с помощью корней "
