#~ "воду любая ваша жажда жидкости будет утолена."

#~ msgid "Electroreceptors"
#~ msgstr "Электрорецепторы"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A network of jelly-filled electroreceptors, like that of a shark, have "
#~ "grown throughout your face and nose.  They are very sensitive to magnetic "
#~ "fields, allowing you to see robots and creatures charged with electricity "
#~ "through walls, but being shocked will seriously mess you up."
