#~ msgid "Find Corporate Accounts"
#~ msgstr "Найти корпоративную бухгалтерию"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Our world fell apart because our leaders were as crooked as the con-men "
#~ "that paid for their elections.  Just find me one of those corporate "
#~ "accounting books and I'll show you and the rest of the world just who is "
