#~ msgstr "Может, ты чего покупаешь или продаёшь?"

#~ msgid "See you around, Draco."
#~ msgstr "Увидимся, Драко."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Well now, my friend-o!  You just asked a mighty fine question.  Folks "
#~ "have been missing the little things in life.  New shoes, new cellphones, "
