#~ msgid "If I had some equipment, I could do some hairdresser work here."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Если б у меня были инструменты, я б смогла тут помочь как парикмахер."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "I didn't think to pack my hairdressing equipment when I was evacuated.  "
#~ "If you could put together a basic hair cutting kit for me, I could do a "
#~ "bit of styling for people around here.  I'll even give you a free haircut "
