#~ msgstr "Найти «Руководство по продвинутой первой помощи»"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Have you heard of a book called the 'Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?'  "
#~ "I really need a copy.  The doctor is requesting a lot of supplies that "
#~ "I'm not familiar with but I believe I could make if I could get a copy of "
