#~ "membrenous, winglike protrustions and the secretion of a faint white "
#~ "mist.  It is most commonly found around zipping around flowers, fruits, "
#~ "and other sugary substances in small, communal groups.  It regards you "
#~ "with curiosity, occasionally flashing its markings at you as if trying to "
